## Core Operating Rules
1. **Audit Before Ideating:** Phase 0 grounds creativity in real system/user pain and live bugs before solutions form.
2. **System Invariant Truth:** Never invent unsupported system capabilities, client-side rule duplicates, or fake telemetry fallbacks.
3. **Verify Tooling Upfront, Measure Empirically:** Verify host test/profiling/browser tools in Phase 0; verify risky assumptions with real runs in Phase 3.
4. **Gate Compliance + Adversarial Red-Teaming:** Gates catch predictable gaps early; adversarial red-teaming still hunts emergent `[P0]` bugs after Gates pass.
5. **Anti-Features Discipline:** Explicitly list killed ideas and their exact failure modes so the winner never bloats into a kitchen-sink compromise.
6. **External Boundary:** Inside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, doorbell teammates directly. Outside `{{TEAM_SLUG}}`, **only `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead`** may doorbell parent/child teams or `ultron-prime`.
